1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:02,330
This restriction... isn't bad.

25
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:05,970
Junior was saved by Teacher a long time ago.

26
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:08,930
She taught me alchemy and cultivation.

27
00:02:09,480 --> 00:02:11,290
Now that she's in trouble,

28
00:02:11,160 --> 00:02:13,050
Junior needs to help her.

29
00:02:21,390 --> 00:02:24,450
This gate connects to Teacher's secret room.

30
00:02:24,200 --> 00:02:25,700
No one knows about it.

31
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:27,250
Junior will guard you.

32
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:29,850
If something is wrong, I will tell Senior.

33
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:40,730
Senior !

34
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:45,690
Senior, are you hurt ?

35
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:46,970
I'm fine.

36
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:48,370
With the talisman,

37
00:02:48,660 --> 00:02:51,450
we can borrow the Heaven Stealing Furnace's energy.

38
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:52,250
Yes.

39
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:54,730
The Heaven Stealing Furnace

40
00:02:54,480 --> 00:02:58,110
was built by the Founder in the early days of the sect.

41
00:02:58,040 --> 00:02:59,410
For thousands of years,

42
00:02:59,150 --> 00:03:02,230
it has accumulated a huge amount of spiritual energy.

43
00:03:02,040 --> 00:03:03,330
Each refinement

44
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:04,650
makes it stronger.

45
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:05,680
You can say that

46
00:03:05,440 --> 00:03:07,400
it's stealing the heavens.

47
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:09,680
Now that we also have the talisman,

48
00:03:09,440 --> 00:03:11,490
once they start refining a pill

49
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:13,410
we will use it

50
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:15,370
to steal their spiritual energy

51
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:17,030
and open the pill seal.

52
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:20,890
Is this furnace also part of the Heaven Stealing Furnace ?

53
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:22,350
Not really.

54
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:27,410
I built this pill furnace in secret after studying the main one.

55
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:30,970
I was planning to use it as my last trump card.

56
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:34,360
If the Sect were to do something to me,

57
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:36,410
I would use this furnace

58
00:03:36,160 --> 00:03:38,890
to turn the main furnace to dust.

59
00:03:38,640 --> 00:03:42,570
Since the Elders would've been busy repairing the furnace,

60
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:45,450
they wouldn't have been able to track me down.

61
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:48,890
After we undo the pill seal,

62
00:03:48,820 --> 00:03:51,250
will the spiritual energy remain in the furnace ?

63
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:51,850
Yes.

64
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:55,920
Then if I cultivate in this furnace,

65
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:58,210
wouldn't it help my breakthrough ?

66
00:04:36,520 --> 00:04:38,130
Fellow cultivators,

67
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:43,050
I know that your precious grade 4 pills

68
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:45,490
were difficult to obtain.

69
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:46,970
You cannot bear to part with them.

70
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:48,090
Senior Ouyang,

71
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:50,640
we don't mind parting with our pills.

72
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:52,850
I just want to ask you

73
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:56,490
if you can guarantee that by sacrificing our grade 4 pills,

74
00:04:56,280 --> 00:05:00,150
we will be able to refine a grade 5 pill ?

75
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:05,170
Don't underestimate alchemy.

76
00:05:04,960 --> 00:05:06,920
What is there to guarantee ?

77
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:09,210
Are you worried for my pill !?

78
00:05:10,520 --> 00:05:11,930
Listen up,

79
00:05:12,280 --> 00:05:14,010
the Pill Sacrifice

80
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:17,330
can indeed increase the success rate of refinement.

81
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:21,170
Alchemy is to refine the spirit of heaven and earth.

82
00:05:21,440 --> 00:05:23,330
Now do what's right !

83
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:28,450
This grade 5 pill will shock the world.

84
00:05:28,200 --> 00:05:30,330
In the future, I will make a grade 6...

85
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:32,770
No, even a grade 7 pill !

86
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:35,250
Don't you want

87
00:05:35,530 --> 00:05:40,010
to follow this old man on this journey ?

88
00:05:42,350 --> 00:05:44,570
We are willing.

89
00:05:44,320 --> 00:05:47,730
The time of Yin has come.

90
00:05:44,320 --> 00:05:47,730
Note: Yin = night, Yang = day

91
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:49,010
Everyone,

92
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:50,390
open the furnace !

93
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:57,610
Pill Sacrifice !

94
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:05,770
It's starting.

95
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:13,690
First sacrifice, grade 4 Demon Blood Pill !

96
00:06:45,200 --> 00:06:46,850
It's really working !

97
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:49,930
This alchemy technique is really advanced.

98
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:53,050
Ouyang Zi is an alchemy genius.

99
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:55,770
He created the Pill Sacrifice method.

100
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:57,970
By sacrificing lower-level pills

101
00:06:57,720 --> 00:07:00,650
it can increase the success rate of refining higher-level pills

102
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:04,870
Second sacrifice, grade 4 Nature Gathering Pill !

103
00:07:07,640 --> 00:07:12,500
Another sacrifice, grade 4 Cloud Stirring Pill !

104
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:15,970
Grade 4 Heaven and Earth Pill !

105
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:18,570
Golden Clouds Pill !

106
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:43,290
Senior, this is a grade 7 Cyan Cloud Pill !

107
00:07:48,690 --> 00:07:50,730
After using the Pill Sacrifice,

108
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:52,890
how can there be so little spiritual energy ?

109
00:07:53,640 --> 00:07:54,730
Forget it,

110
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:57,650
even if I need to use the Heaven Stealing Formation,

111
00:07:57,440 --> 00:08:00,330
I will make sure my pill succeeds !

112
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:09,390
This is bad, they will find the secret room.

113
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:12,690
Senior, don't move.

114
00:08:12,440 --> 00:08:14,410
Wan'er will take care of this.

115
00:08:18,200 --> 00:08:19,330
The Ancestors ordered...

116
00:08:19,080 --> 00:08:21,170
I will help Senior Ouyang.

117
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:22,930
Are you sure you want to stop me ?

118
00:08:50,280 --> 00:08:51,330
No !

119
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:53,570
This cannot be happening to me !

120
00:08:54,400 --> 00:08:56,250
I will help you, Senior Ouyang.

121
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:58,690
That's very kind of you.

122
00:08:59,040 --> 00:09:00,810
Senior's cultivation is profound,

123
00:09:00,560 --> 00:09:02,970
you should control the flow of spiritual energy.

124
00:09:03,310 --> 00:09:05,930
Let Junior handle the Heaven Stealing Furnace.

125
00:09:05,680 --> 00:09:06,860
Okay.

126
00:09:09,360 --> 00:09:11,930
This vortex of energy is extremely violent.

127
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:14,930
Even a Nascent Soul would have trouble absorbing it.

128
00:09:14,800 --> 00:09:17,470
This should compensate how much we are stealing.

129
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,130
I've done it !

130
00:09:45,680 --> 00:09:50,490
My own grade 5 pill is taking shape !

131
00:09:51,520 --> 00:09:52,410
Senior,

132
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:55,770
you will need to rely on yourself now.

133
00:10:26,280 --> 00:10:28,170
Original body, appear !

134
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:01,610
Sun Zhenwei ?

135
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:11,530
What are you plotting ?

136
00:11:18,680 --> 00:11:21,730
Elder Li, the ceremony is in a few days.

137
00:11:21,790 --> 00:11:23,730
Even without makeup,

138
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:25,530
you need to try your wedding dress.

139
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:27,990
It will be troublesome if it doesn't fit you.

140
00:11:29,400 --> 00:11:32,370
Senior has been in seclusion for a few days...

141
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:34,250
I wonder if it's going well.

142
00:11:34,680 --> 00:11:36,850
You're so ungrateful !

143
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:40,050
Don't test my patience.

144
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:48,130
What was your apprentice's name again ?

145
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,050
Oh, right.

146
00:11:49,040 --> 00:11:50,250
Zhou Lin.

147
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:52,570
He's very loyal to you.

148
00:11:52,610 --> 00:11:53,880
What did you do ?

149
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:56,050
He's not very smart.

150
00:11:56,620 --> 00:11:59,710
That day, your apprentice was acting suspiciously.

151
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:02,510
And you never helped Ouyang Zi before.

152
00:12:03,420 --> 00:12:05,730
I asked him about it

153
00:12:05,880 --> 00:12:07,740
but he was shameless.

154
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:09,850
He chose death over having his soul searched.

155
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:12,130
So I had to fulfill his wish.

156
00:12:13,920 --> 00:12:15,370
How dare you !

157
00:12:16,480 --> 00:12:18,410
This is the Cloud Sky Sect,

158
00:12:18,160 --> 00:12:20,660
it doesn't matter if I kill him.

159
00:12:20,600 --> 00:12:23,890
It doesn't matter if I kill you either.

160
00:12:25,040 --> 00:12:27,580
I advise you to stay put.

161
00:12:27,350 --> 00:12:30,210
Whether you obey me or not,

162
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:32,570
it all depends on you.

163
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:37,490
I'm sorry, Teacher troubled you.

164
00:13:01,040 --> 00:13:03,300
The Nascent Soul Embryo is forming,

165
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:05,770
I just need to keep injecting spiritual energy into it.

166
00:13:14,680 --> 00:13:15,730
Come back !

167
00:13:20,210 --> 00:13:23,800
The Ji Realm is preventing me from reaching Nascent Soul again.

168
00:13:47,400 --> 00:13:50,290
Wow, the Cloud Sky Sect is so luxurious !

169
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:53,850
I heard Elder Li is very beautiful.

170
00:13:54,320 --> 00:13:56,330
Please come in.

171
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:57,850
Please.

172
00:14:07,800 --> 00:14:09,410
Congratulations !

173
00:14:12,120 --> 00:14:14,170
Brother Liu, how are you ?

174
00:14:14,580 --> 00:14:17,740
Tianyi Zhenren
Luoyue Sect Leader
Middle stage Nascent Soul

175
00:14:14,920 --> 00:14:18,410
The number one Sect in the country of Chu

176
00:14:18,160 --> 00:14:20,640
really impresses me.

177
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:23,730
I wonder when we can share our knowledge.

178
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:26,930
It's just a matter of reputation.

179
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:27,450
Liu Fei
Cloud Sky Sect Leader
Middle stage Nascent Soul

180
00:14:27,270 --> 00:14:30,170
There are hermits with higher cultivation than mine,

181
00:14:29,920 --> 00:14:32,090
way more talented than me.

182
00:14:31,840 --> 00:14:37,650
So there are other Ancestors in the Cloud Sky Sect ?

183
00:14:40,040 --> 00:14:40,930
Please.

184
00:14:40,680 --> 00:14:41,370
Okay.

185
00:14:46,680 --> 00:14:47,690
Congratulations.

186
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:48,650
Thank you.

187
00:14:48,800 --> 00:14:50,660
Congratulations fellow cultivator Sun.

188
00:14:49,640 --> 00:14:50,770
Please come in.

189
00:14:51,680 --> 00:14:53,370
Greetings, Tianyi Zhenren.

190
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:56,010
Is this the groom ?

191
00:14:55,800 --> 00:14:57,850
You really are Lingwu's son,

192
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:59,600
a handsome talented man.

193
00:15:00,110 --> 00:15:01,410
You're flattering me.

194
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:07,370
Go on.

195
00:15:07,600 --> 00:15:08,650
Okay.

196
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:10,250
Congratulations.

197
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:11,190
Thank you.

198
00:15:14,370 --> 00:15:17,050
I advise you to be obedient.

199
00:15:16,800 --> 00:15:20,690
Otherwise, someone else you know might get hurt again.

200
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:23,290
Congratulations fellow cultivator Sun.

201
00:15:23,080 --> 00:15:24,570
Thank you, thank you.

202
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:25,540
Please,

203
00:15:25,800 --> 00:15:27,010
both of you come in.

204
00:15:27,280 --> 00:15:28,730
What an ideal couple !

205
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:30,340
Thank you. thank you.

206
00:15:29,270 --> 00:15:31,170
Senior...

207
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:37,980
Fellow cultivators, long time no see.

208
00:15:37,920 --> 00:15:40,170
We must drink today to celebrate.

209
00:15:42,200 --> 00:15:43,690
It's time !

210
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:52,570
It's really a perfect match.

211
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:54,330
A cultivator with a grade 5 achemist,

212
00:15:54,080 --> 00:15:56,530
it's only a matter of time before he reaches Nascent Soul.

213
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:58,690
This Zhenwei couple is truly beautiful.

214
00:15:58,440 --> 00:16:00,090
This kid is lucky !

215
00:16:01,920 --> 00:16:03,370
What an ideal couple,

216
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:04,870
they're perfect for each other.

217
00:16:10,840 --> 00:16:15,160
Today is the day of your Dual Cultivation ceremony.

218
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:17,970
It's a happy day for our Cloud Sky Sect !

219
00:16:18,160 --> 00:16:21,810
I wish you two a happy marriage,

220
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:25,570
may you live happily ever after.

221
00:16:29,200 --> 00:16:30,930
We cultivators,

222
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:33,210
don't go through every mortal rite.

223
00:16:33,760 --> 00:16:35,690
After you drink this cup of wine,

224
00:16:35,480 --> 00:16:37,850
consider the ceremony to be complete.

225
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:45,090
Don't mess with me now.

226
00:17:12,120 --> 00:17:13,530
What's going on ?

227
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:30,170
Senior !

228
00:17:39,810 --> 00:17:43,940
I've had my share of wounds,

229
00:17:41,850 --> 00:17:43,940
now I want to fight back.

230
00:17:43,770 --> 00:17:47,500
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

231
00:17:47,330 --> 00:17:53,420
that's blocking all my hopes

232
00:17:50,210 --> 00:17:53,420
for life ?

233
00:17:54,970 --> 00:17:59,180
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

234
00:17:56,690 --> 00:17:59,180
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

235
00:17:59,250 --> 00:18:02,580
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

236
00:18:02,690 --> 00:18:08,580
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

237
00:18:05,410 --> 00:18:08,580
out of reach.

238
00:18:09,690 --> 00:18:14,060
Immortals

239
00:18:10,730 --> 00:18:14,060
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

240
00:18:14,090 --> 00:18:18,100
Renegades

241
00:18:14,850 --> 00:18:18,100
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

242
00:18:17,850 --> 00:18:21,940
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

243
00:18:19,800 --> 00:18:21,940
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

244
00:18:21,930 --> 00:18:26,060
because I don't see the harm in that.

245
00:18:27,810 --> 00:18:33,860
My new body opens its eyes

246
00:18:30,330 --> 00:18:33,860
and awakens from its dream.

247
00:18:33,730 --> 00:18:41,420
I have overcome many trials

248
00:18:35,850 --> 00:18:41,420
to get this body back.

249
00:18:41,370 --> 00:18:49,060
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

250
00:18:45,410 --> 00:18:49,060
I can still see.

251
00:18:49,210 --> 00:18:58,420
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

252
00:18:53,170 --> 00:18:58,420
by my own hands.

253
00:19:13,610 --> 00:19:19,820
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

254
00:19:16,330 --> 00:19:19,820
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

255
00:19:19,570 --> 00:19:27,380
With a flick of a finger,

256
00:19:21,010 --> 00:19:27,380
only my indomitable heart remains.

257
00:19:27,170 --> 00:19:36,780
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

258
00:19:33,130 --> 00:19:36,780
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

259
00:19:36,770 --> 00:19:44,620
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

260
00:19:39,290 --> 00:19:44,620
like the descent of a god.
